Package: termux-gamepad
Architecture: aarch64
Version: 0.1.0
Maintainer: moio9
Homepage: https://github.com/moio9/termux-gamepad
Depends: libx11, libxi, procps, coreutils, termux-exec
Breaks: sdl2 (= 2.32.10+termuxgamepad1), sdl2 (= 2.32.10+termuxgamepad2), sdl2 (= 2.32.10+termuxgamepad3)
Replaces: sdl2 (<< 2.32.10+termuxgamepad4)
Description: Experimental Termux:X11 controller bridge and native libraries
 Provides libtermux-gamepad, scoped udev/evdev compatibility libraries,
 the XI2 bridge, launch tools and a shell profile for controller support.
 Requires a matching Termux:X11 build with LORIE-CONTROLLER support.
